WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.689
This briefing comes from Book 12 of
the Federal Modernization Workbook,

2
00:00:04.689 --> 00:00:09.792
Security Operations and Telemetry: how
an agency makes every part of its estate

3
00:00:09.792 --> 00:00:14.663
emit evidence, turns it into detection
and response, and proves that it works.

4
00:00:14.663 --> 00:00:18.408
I'll take four questions: why you
can't defend what you can't see,

5
00:00:18.408 --> 00:00:22.004
what each plane must emit and
how findings reach one queue,

6
00:00:22.004 --> 00:00:26.949
who runs security operations, and how to
run detection, response and monitoring.

7
00:00:26.949 --> 00:00:30.847
The short version: design
visibility instead of assuming it,

8
00:00:30.847 --> 00:00:34.660
and close a finding only when
the thing is fixed, with proof.
